url: "https://github.com/D-sudoasd/ezDIC"
repository-code: "https://github.com/D-sudoasd/ezDIC"
abstract: "ezDIC is a lightweight dual-mode workstation for image sequences: a virtual extensometer for engineering and true strain histories, and an in-plane full-field 2D DIC workflow that correlates each deformation frame to one fixed reference frame and computes displacement and strain on a POI grid with IC-GN or IC-LM. Full-field x/y/u/v values are in px, strain is dimensionless, Exy/exy are tensor shear components, and failed points remain NaN; the result is not per-pixel or 3D DIC."
keywords:
  - Digital image correlation
  - virtual extensometer
  - strain extraction
  - engineering strain
  - true strain
  - materials testing
  - full-field 2D DIC
  - POI grid
